@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
    <h1 class="mb-0">GlassFab Asset Management</h1>
</div>

<p>
    Welcome to the GlassFab Asset Management System. This application is used to manage
    <strong>Locations</strong>, <strong>Devices</strong>, and <strong>Influx configurations</strong>
    for production data collection and monitoring.
</p>

<p>
    Use the navigation menu to configure line locations, assign and maintain device records,
    and manage Influx logging rules tied to PLC tags.
</p>

<p>
    Each page has its own help guide to walk you through changing configurations
</p>
